  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iNG1TLm.png\" width=\"945\" height=\"116\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<p>Minecraft 的字型看起來很奇怪嗎？&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這個材質包將為您修復！</p>\n<p>本套件基於 Faithful 32 材質包（已進行修改）</p>\n<p>但僅套用於 Minecraft 字型（包含文字、數字等）&nbsp;</p>\n<p>支援所有版本！</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>注意事項：</strong></span></p>\n<p>支援模組</p>\n<p>歡迎將此材質包加入您的模組整合包中</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>範例：&nbsp;</strong></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/457/256/310/172/2.png\" width=\"404\" height=\"185\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">更多內容請見 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-font/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">圖片</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">衷心感謝大家突破百萬下載！</span></strong></span></p>",
